  "notes": "<p>Reba was unfinished and did not contain the whistling ending. Trey teased The Greater Good in Roses Are Free. Split Open and Melt and Kill Devil Falls were also unfinished. The last Tweezer Reprise of the first set contained Split Open and Melt teases by Fish. Trey, Mike, and Page teased The Secret of Life (The Dead Milkmen) in Kill Devil Falls. Tweezer, which was played as an encore for the first time, ended abruptly with a \"Do you get it?\" sound bite immediately following the song's conclusion. The soundcheck's jam included Come Together teases from Trey. This show was officially released as part of the <i>Live in Saratoga Springs 2025</i> digital box set.</p>",
